s, Time differences, Number bases results, Temperatures values, or editing and rotation. Editing Expenses with text entry garbled the rent line, so that file's data is now altered.", "verdict": "PASS"}}, "tool_use_meta": [{"id": "toolu_0148J7NYEnz1ALntdEbtrx17", "display_name": "Sign Off", "server_display_name": "aqb-device", "tool_name": "sign_off"}]}
